            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> This actually also happen with `cover_or_next`\r\n\r\nI can not reproduce. The search is [first performed in current line and only then in neighborhood](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e50cf9de614500a20e47cfc50e30a100042f91c3/doc/mini-surround.txt#L522-L523). It means that with `\"cover_or_next\"` search method, it first tries to find covering surrounding inside current line and fails which is followed by next surrounding and succeeds.",
